Owner batch, verified live via CDP:
- Right rail: single-view switcher (Sources/Browser/Preview segmented control, one visible) replacing side-by-side tabs
- Titlebar: per-route icon gating — clean top-right on Study/Graph/Recorder/Library; rail toggle only on chat; haptics/kbd/settings removed for student build
- Account + Settings moved to lower-left sidebar footer (avatar/email/plan pill + gear)
- Browser mirror: capture at devicePixelRatio (retina) + higher JPEG quality (was blurry 1x upscaled)
- Graph: theme-aware colors (light bg in light mode / dark in dark, reads --ui-* tokens, reacts to theme) + legible GRAPH CONTROLS card
- Study heatmap: full rolling year (53wk) + tied to REAL reviews (seed fakery removed; grade appends a review)
- Study: create + assign deck SECTIONS (New section dialog, grouped headers)
- Recorder: on stop, auto-save transcript (+AI notes) as a Library/Lectures note

Shell/rail authored by Codex Run A; graph/study/recorder by Codex Run B; mirror by hand. Compiled clean first try.
